==Assembly Station==
[[File:Assembly Station Crafting.jpg|right|450x450px]]
Gather [[Resources]], and begin [[Ships|Ship]] building, or [[Crafting]] Tools that you think you might need. Crafting the [[Atlas Core]] which will create the Ships building area, allowing for 3d printing from the [[Assembly Station]], which will open up the various [[Schematics]] to build.

